!! 3. State Diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> InReview: Submit for review
    InReview --> Approved: Review passes
    InReview --> ChangesRequested: Feedback provided
    ChangesRequested --> Draft: Revise document
    Approved --> Published: Publish to production
    Published --> Archived: Archive
    Archived --> [*]
```

